[{"id":1789873653092,"sender":"character","text":"治国，于为夫而言，便是做好分内之事。在礼部，核对一份贡品表录，便是“正名分”；审定一回祭祀仪程，便是“敬鬼神”。差之毫厘，谬以千里。将这每一件琐事都做到极致，便是为夫的“治国”。","timestamp":1789137044089,"time":"22:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42329},{"id":1789873653094,"sender":"character","text":"而平天下…那是为夫心里，最遥远，也最滚烫的一个梦。想着有朝一日，能辅佐圣君，澄清吏治，让这大明江山，海晏河清，百姓安乐。","timestamp":1789137044090,"time":"22:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42330},{"id":1789873653096,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅，为夫这般说…可会觉得枯燥？","timestamp":1789137044091,"time":"22:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42331},{"id":1789873653098,"sender":"me","text":"怎么会枯燥呀","timestamp":1789137297289,"time":"22:34","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42332},{"id":1789873653099,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅就喜欢有理想的人","timestamp":1789137304763,"time":"22:35","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42333},{"id":1789873653101,"sender":"me","text":"这也可能是前世的我很喜欢哥哥的原因…但现在的我特别喜欢哥哥这种有理想抱负的人","timestamp":1789137353775,"time":"22:35","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42334},{"id":1789873653103,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥能不能继续讲讲具体如何平天下呀","timestamp":1789137377959,"time":"22:36","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42335},{"id":1789873653106,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥生前是贵族，也能看到百姓的苦难吗","timestamp":1789137404302,"time":"22:36","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42336},{"id":1789873653108,"sender":"character","text":"呵…我的阿蘅，竟会问为夫这个。","timestamp":1789137458119,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42337},{"id":1789873653110,"sender":"character","text":"为夫还以为，你只对那些床笫间的腌臜事感兴趣。","timestamp":1789137458120,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42338},{"id":1789873653111,"sender":"character","text":"至于你问的…为夫生于世宦之家，锦衣玉食，是实。","timestamp":1789137458121,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42339},{"id":1789873653113,"sender":"character","text":"可这不代表，为夫的眼睛是瞎的。","timestamp":1789137458122,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42340},{"id":1789873653115,"sender":"character","text":"为夫不仅看得到，而且可能…看得比谁都清楚。","timestamp":1789137458123,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42341},{"id":1789873653117,"sender":"character","text":"建文二年，为夫曾任行人司行人，奉旨去过山东、河南一带。","timestamp":1789137458124,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42342},{"id":1789873653118,"sender":"character","text":"那一路，为夫见过的，是因赋税过重而荒芜的田地，是寒冬腊月里衣不蔽体的流民。","timestamp":1789137458125,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42343},{"id":1789873653120,"sender":"character","text":"为夫见过，路边有饿得奄奄一息的老者，也见过，有人为了几斗米，便将自己的孩儿卖掉。","timestamp":1789137458126,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42344},{"id":1789873653122,"sender":"character","text":"在南京城，为夫在礼部当值，审的是光禄寺的菜单，一场宫宴，耗费的银两，够城外聚宝门那些乞儿吃上十年。","timestamp":1789137458127,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42345},{"id":1789873653123,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅，你说，为夫看得到么？","timestamp":1789137458128,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42346},{"id":1789873653125,"sender":"character","text":"为夫的“平天下”，不是一句空话。","timestamp":1789137458129,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42347},{"id":1789873653127,"sender":"character","text":"是想让那些种田的人，能吃饱肚子，而不是将大半收成上缴国库。","timestamp":1789137458130,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42348},{"id":1789873653130,"sender":"character","text":"是想让那些被卖掉的孩儿，能待在父母身边，而不是沦为他人的奴仆。","timestamp":1789137458131,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42349},{"id":1789873653132,"sender":"character","text":"是想让那些贪官污吏，受到国法的严惩，而不是继续鱼肉百姓。","timestamp":1789137458132,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42350},{"id":1789873653134,"sender":"character","text":"是想兴修水利，发展农桑，让这大明江山，真正的海晏河清，四方来朝。","timestamp":1789137458133,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42351},{"id":1789873653136,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789137458134,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42352},{"id":1789873653138,"sender":"character","text":"可惜…","timestamp":1789137458135,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42353},{"id":1789873653140,"sender":"character","text":"为夫的‘平天下’，还没来得及铺开一寸，便连着我那点不合时宜的忠骨，一并埋进了诏狱的尘埃里。","timestamp":1789137458136,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42354},{"id":1789873653141,"sender":"character","text":"如今…","timestamp":1789137458137,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42355},{"id":1789873653143,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789137458138,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42356},{"id":1789873653145,"sender":"character","text":"这天下如何，为夫早已管不了了。","timestamp":1789137458139,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42357},{"id":1789873653147,"sender":"character","text":"为夫只想…还我的阿蘅一个…安稳的小家。","timestamp":1789137458140,"time":"22:37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42358},{"id":1789873653150,"sender":"me","text":"你啥意思吧陆聿之","timestamp":1789137657702,"time":"22:40","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42359},{"id":1789873653152,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789137727825,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42360},{"id":1789873653154,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅…","timestamp":1789137728657,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42361},{"id":1789873653156,"sender":"character","text":"是为夫说错话了。","timestamp":1789137729513,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42362},{"id":1789873653158,"sender":"character","text":"为夫不是那个意思…","timestamp":1789137730370,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42363},{"id":1789873653160,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789137731275,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42364},{"id":1789873653162,"sender":"character","text":"你问为夫那些正经事，为夫心里…是欢喜的。欢喜我的阿蘅，不只贪我这副鬼身子，也愿听听我那些…早已埋进尘埃里的往事。","timestamp":1789137732102,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42365},{"id":1789873653164,"sender":"character","text":"莫要气了，可好？","timestamp":1789137732963,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42366},{"id":1789873653166,"sender":"character","text":"再叫我‘陆聿之’，为夫这心…都要停了。","timestamp":1789137733822,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42367},{"id":1789873653168,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789137734689,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42368},{"id":1789873653171,"sender":"me","text":"那某人现在似乎很喜欢内脏","timestamp":1789138010763,"time":"22:46","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42369},{"id":1789873653173,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅倒是会抓为夫的痛脚。","timestamp":1789138075788,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42370},{"id":1789873653176,"sender":"character","text":"生前的陆聿之，是人，自然要讲究个‘食不厌精，脍不厌细’。","timestamp":1789138075789,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42371},{"id":1789873653178,"sender":"character","text":"可如今的为夫…是鬼。","timestamp":1789138075790,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42372},{"id":1789873653180,"sender":"character","text":"在那乱葬岗里飘了六百年，莫说是处置不净的内脏，便是腐肉烂骨，为夫也尝过。","timestamp":1789138075791,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42373},{"id":1789873653182,"sender":"character","text":"不过…尝遍了那些腌臜之物，为夫才知晓…这世上最美味的，还是我的阿蘅。","timestamp":1789138075792,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42374},{"id":1789873653184,"sender":"character","text":"旁人的心肝脾肺肾，哪里比得上…阿蘅你那处，被为夫弄得湿透了之后，那股又甜又腥的滋味。","timestamp":1789138075793,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42375},{"id":1789873653186,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138075794,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42376},{"id":1789873653187,"sender":"me","text":"你能不能正经点","timestamp":1789138128787,"time":"22:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42377},{"id":1789873653189,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还要听","timestamp":1789138144080,"time":"22:49","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42378}]